<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Payment Confirmed — HospiceLink CRM</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{min-height:100vh;background:radial-gradient(circle at top,#14345f 0%,#09162b 34%,#050b15 100%);font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;color:#f5f8ff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:40px 20px}
a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:40px}
.logo-icon{width:44px;height:44px;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:#07111f}
.logo-name{font-weight:900;color:#fff;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3}
.logo-sub{color:#8b949e;font-size:11px}
.card{max-width:580px;width:100%;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0d1730,#09101f);border:2px solid rgba(63,185,80,.4);border-radius:24px;padding:40px 32px;text-align:center}
.success-icon{width:72px;height:72px;background:rgba(63,185,80,.15);border:2px solid rgba(63,185,80,.4);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 20px;font-size:36px}
.card h1{font-size:32px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;margin:0 0 8px}
.card .sub{color:#8cff66;font-weight:800;font-size:16px;margin:0 0 20px}
.email-box{background:rgba(73,182,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(73,182,255,.3);border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:24px;text-align:left;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px}
.email-icon{font-size:22px;color:#49b6ff;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px}
.email-title{color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 6px}
.email-body{color:#8b949e;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}
.steps{text-align:left;margin-bottom:28px}
.steps-label{color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 12px}
.step-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:10px}
.step-num{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:900;flex-shrink:0}
.step-text{color:#c7d3e8;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:4px}
.cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:0}
.btn-open{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#82f86b,#b8ff79);color:#08101b;border-radius:999px;padding:13px 22px;font-weight:900;font-size:14px}
.btn-back{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:#c7d3e8;border-radius:999px;padding:13px 22px;font-weight:800;font-size:14px}
.btn-open:hover,.btn-back:hover{opacity:.88}
.support{margin-top:28px;text-align:center}
.support p{color:#4a5568;font-size:13px;margin:0 0 6px}
.support-links{display:flex;gap:20px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.support-links a{color:#49b6ff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
.footer{color:#2a3a55;font-size:12px;margin-top:32px}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="logo">
  <div class="logo-icon">WM+</div>
  <div>
    <div class="logo-name">We Market Plus LLC</div>
    <div class="logo-sub">HospiceLink CRM</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <div class="success-icon">✅</div>
  <h1>🎉 Payment Confirmed!</h1>
  <p class="sub">Your account is ready. Check your email for login instructions.</p>

  <div class="email-box">
    <div class="email-icon">✉</div>
    <div>
      <p class="email-title">Check Your Email — Your Credentials Are On the Way</p>
      <p class="email-body">We're generating your one-time passcode and sending your welcome email now. It typically arrives within <strong style="color:#fff">1–3 minutes</strong>. Check your spam folder if you don't see it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="steps">
    <p class="steps-label">What happens next:</p>
    <div class="step-row">
      <div class="step-num" style="background:rgba(73,182,255,.18);border:1.5px solid rgba(73,182,255,.35);color:#49b6ff">1</div>
      <p class="step-text">Open the welcome email — it contains your login link and setup guides</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-row">
      <div class="step-num" style="background:rgba(140,255,102,.18);border:1.5px solid rgba(140,255,102,.35);color:#8cff66">2</div>
      <p class="step-text">Click the login link to access your CRM (same email you purchased with)</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-row">
      <div class="step-num" style="background:rgba(255,215,0,.18);border:1.5px solid rgba(255,215,0,.35);color:#ffd700">3</div>
      <p class="step-text">Set your password on first login — do this immediately to secure your account</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-row">
      <div class="step-num" style="background:rgba(201,174,255,.18);border:1.5px solid rgba(201,174,255,.35);color:#c9aeff">4</div>
      <p class="step-text">Follow the Setup Guide inside Resources / Setup to go live in under 30 minutes</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-row">
    <a href="/" class="btn-open">→ Open Your CRM →</a>
    <a href="/" class="btn-back">📖 Back to Website</a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="support">
  <p>Didn't receive your email after 5 minutes?</p>
  <div class="support-links">
    <a href="mailto:info@wemarketplus.com">✉ info@wemarketplus.com</a>
    <a href="tel:+14697930673">📞 (469) 793-0673</a>
  </div>
</div>

<p class="footer">© 2026 We Market Plus LLC · HospiceLink CRM</p>

</body>
</html>
